  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women-Led Alternatives to Climate Change in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work in four regions of Cambodia (two coastal areas - Kampot and Koh Kong, and two in the Tonle Sap/Great Lake area - Kampong Thom and Pursat) to harness women&#x2019;s potential to effect change and build more community resilience and capacity to better manage disaster and climate related risks</narrative>
  </description>
